# Copy to .lhxignore in the local directory from which you start the agent.
# Alternative: LHX_IGNORE_FILE=/absolute/operator/policy or local config ignore_file.
# No paths are ignored by default. Keep real credentials in vendor/generated/tests visible.
# Patterns match case-sensitive URL paths (without query/fragment) or local paths.
# Explicitly choose scopes; do not copy these examples blindly.
# path:vendor/known-public-bundle.js
# rule:generic_api_key
# finding:<32-to-64-character-lowercase-hex-fingerprint>
# test:<32-to-64-character-lowercase-hex-fingerprint>
# Never put a raw credential in this file.
# Evidence stays in scan history, and Delta does not treat suppression as remediation.
